## The Gender Advisory Committee (GAC)\
\
The GAC was inaugurated on 24 April 2025 at the project inception meeting. It brings together leaders from women's organisations, disability rights groups, energy and extractives governance institutions, and the private sector to ensure GESI considerations are embedded in research design, data collection instruments, validation, and final recommendations.\
\
**Members include:** Georgette Barnes (Women in Mining Ghana), Chibeze Ezekiel (SYND Ghana), Nafi Chinery (Natural Resource Governance Institute), Rushaiya Ibrahim-Tanko (Energy for Growth Hub), Eunice Biritwum (Ghana Energy Commission), Dr Steve Manteaw (Ghana EITI), Joshua Addy (National Council on Persons with Disability), Gloria Kuzo, and Valerie Labi (Wahu Mobility).\
